Fix for building in ABS_SYMLINK mode.

cling tries to load the PCM file for a library in the same directory as the
library, after resolving symlinks.
But the libraries are built in the build/PACK/lib directory and the PCM
files in build/PACK/rootdict.  They both get symlinked in inst/lib,
but that doesn't help.  Fix by putting a link to the PCM in build/PACK/lib.
